>> title: Molasses Crinkles
>> category: Cookies
>> tags: molasses, ginger, spice, dessert, oven
>> counters: Bakery
>> aka: molasses cookies, soft molasses cookies, ginger molasses cookies
>> servings: 48
>> time: 1 hour 30 min
>> step.3: beat in
>> step.7: roll in sugar, bake 375°F (190°C) 11 min

Heat the #oven{} to 375°F (190°C) and line two #baking sheets{} with parchment.

Cream @unsalted butter{3/4%cup}(170 g; softened) with @dark brown sugar{1%cup}(220 g).

Beat @molasses{1/4%cup}(85 g) and @egg{1%large}(50 g) into @&(~1)creamed butter{}.

Whisk @all-purpose flour{2 1/4%cup}(280 g), @baking soda{2%tsp}(12 g), @ground ginger{1%tsp}(2 g), @ground cinnamon{1%tsp}(2.6 g), @ground cloves{1/2%tsp}(1 g), and @table salt{1/4%tsp}(1.5 g).

Stir @&(~1)dry ingredients{} into @&(~2)batter{}.

Cover @&(~1)dough{} and chill for ~{1%hour}.

Roll @&(~1)dough{} into balls in @granulated sugar{1/4%cup}(50 g) and bake at 375°F for ~{11%min}.
